 "description": "<p>Coral fleece in bear styling: neck ring, dress, and bracelet, in white or brown, one size for 40-60 kg. The fleece is the whole point - this is the costume you pick when every other option looks cold.</p>\n<p>The bandeau dress is a straight drape, which fleece handles well, and the neck ring and bracelet carry the bear cues without a full mascot commitment. White and brown choose between polar and classic.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: coral fleece</li>\n<li>Includes: neck ring, dress, bracelet</li>\n<li>Style: bear</li>\n<li>Color: white or brown</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One size for 40-60 kg. Lounging, cozy costume nights, and cold apartments all covered.</p>\n",
